  "_title": "NAND is enough",
  "_description": "NOT, AND and OR built from nothing but 74HC00 NAND gates. Tie a NAND's two inputs together and it inverts; invert a NAND and it ANDs; NAND two inverted inputs and De Morgan hands you OR. One gate type can build every other — which is why a chip fab only needs to be good at one thing.",
